      "text": "Most blockchains chase hype.\n\n@VenomFoundation is chasing something different: infrastructure that governments, banks, and enterprises can actually rely on.\n\nVenom is built for high-stakes environments, and it shows:\n\n• Ultra-low fees  \n• Massive scalability  \n• Dynamic sharding that adjusts instantly as traffic spikes  \n\nThis is why real institutions are choosing it:  \n➾ Powering national digitalization efforts in the Philippines  \n➾ Working with the UAE Ministry of Climate Change on a carbon credit system  \n➾ Expanding enterprise development across Africa  \n➾ In talks with a major Chinese fintech leader  \n\nVenom isn’t just another chain. It’s a global B2B/B2G infrastructure layer moving toward 500,000 daily transactions.\n\nJoin w/t me to share the $13,000 PrizePool 👉 https://t.co/oja6L8V6NS\nhttps://t.co/LXEXV8e6MV\n\n#Layer0 #EnterpriseBlockchain #GovTech\n#BingXSpotBlast",
